Third-party material
--------------------

* K82 bootstrap voice model: the weights and voice packs are converted from
  Kokoro-82M v1.0 by hexgrad (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M),
  released under the Apache License 2.0. Inhouse TTS does not redistribute
  them in this repository; the build downloads and converts them.

* English pronunciation lexicons in crates/inhouse-tts-text/data/ are derived
  from the misaki gold and silver dictionaries by hexgrad
  (https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki), Apache License 2.0. They were merged
  and re-encoded in the `.lex` text format; the pronunciations are unchanged.

No GPL code (e.g. espeak-ng) is used or linked by Inhouse TTS.
